
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Privacy Policy | Proof Restaurant Consulting</title>
<meta name="description" content="Learn about the privacy practices of Proof Restaurant Consulting.">
<style>
:root{--dark:#152b24;--green:#345d49;--cream:#f8f8f3;--soft:#edf2e8;--muted:#59695f;--border:#dce4d8}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth;scroll-padding-top:85px}
body{margin:0;background:var(--cream);color:var(--dark);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:1.8}
a{text-decoration:none;color:inherit}
h1,h2{font-weight:800;line-height:1.2;margin:0 0 20px}
h1{font-size:clamp(2.6rem,5vw,4.6rem)}
h2{font-size:25px}
p{color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 18px}
.container{max-width:1140px;margin:auto;padding:0 20px}
.narrow{max-width:850px;margin:auto}
section{padding:75px 0}
.kicker{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:2px;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--green);margin-bottom:13px}
.btn{display:inline-block;border:2px solid transparent;border-radius:8px;padding:12px 22px;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;text-align:center}
.btn-proof,.btn-proof:visited{background:var(--dark);border-color:var(--dark);color:white!important}
.btn-proof:hover,.btn-proof:focus{background:var(--green);border-color:var(--green);color:white!important}
.navbar{background:var(--cream);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);position:sticky;top:0;z-index:100}
.nav-inner{min-height:76px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px}
.navbar-brand{font-weight:900;font-size:30px;letter-spacing:-1px}
.logo-dot{color:#8cae60}
.nav-links{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:24px}
.nav-links a:not(.btn){font-size:14px;font-weight:700}
.nav-links .btn{font-size:14px;padding:9px 18px}
.nav-toggle{display:none;background:none;border:1px solid var(--green);border-radius:7px;font-size:25px;padding:3px 12px;color:var(--dark);cursor:pointer}
.page-hero{background:var(--soft);padding:90px 0 75px}
.page-hero p{font-size:19px;max-width:760px}
.legal h2{margin:35px 0 12px}
.notice{background:var(--soft);padding:20px;border-radius:9px;font-size:14px;color:var(--green);margin-top:40px}
footer{background:#10231b;padding:45px 0 25px;color:white}
footer p,footer a:not(.navbar-brand){color:#bdcbbd}
.footer-inner{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:30px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.footer-links{display:flex;gap:18px;flex-wrap:wrap}
footer hr{border:0;border-top:1px solid #48604f;margin:30px 0 15px}
.small{font-size:13px}
@media(max-width:767px){
section{padding:55px 0}
.page-hero{padding:60px 0}
.nav-inner{flex-wrap:wrap}
.nav-toggle{display:block}
.nav-links{display:none;flex-direction:column;align-items:stretch;width:100%;gap:0;padding-bottom:15px}
.nav-links.open{display:flex}
.nav-links a{padding:10px 0}
.nav-links .btn{margin-top:8px}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header class="navbar">
<div class="container nav-inner">
<a class="navbar-brand" href="index.html">proof<span class="logo-dot">.</span></a>
<button class="nav-toggle" aria-label="Toggle navigation" aria-controls="nav" aria-expanded="false">☰</button>
<nav class="nav-links" id="nav">
<a href="index.html">Home</a>
<a href="index.html#services">Services</a>
<a href="about.html">About</a>
<a href="contact.html">Contact</a>
<a class="btn btn-proof" href="contact.html#booking">Book a Call</a>
</nav>
</div>
</header>

<main>
<section class="page-hero">
<div class="container">
<div class="kicker">Your Privacy Matters</div>
<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
<p>Information about how Proof Restaurant Consulting handles website interactions and personal information.</p>
<p class="small">Effective Date: [Insert Date]</p>
</div>
</section>

<section>
<div class="container">
<div class="narrow legal">
<p>This Privacy Policy describes the privacy practices of Proof Restaurant Consulting ("Proof," "we," "us," or "our") in connection with this website.</p>

<h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
<p>Our website currently displays forms for restaurant consulting inquiries and free resources. These forms are not connected to a submission system. Information entered into them is not transmitted to Proof or stored by the form scripts.</p>
<p>If these features are activated, we may collect your name, email address, phone number, business name, business stage and information about your consulting needs.</p>

<h2>2. How Information May Be Used</h2>
<p>When lead collection becomes active, information may be used to respond to inquiries, discuss consulting services, provide requested resources and communicate about potential business relationships.</p>
<p>We will update this policy to reflect the actual services used before activating data collection.</p>

<h2>3. Hosting and Technical Information</h2>
<p>Our hosting provider may automatically process technical information such as your IP address, browser details, requested pages and server logs when you visit this website.</p>

<h2>4. Analytics and Cookies</h2>
<p>The current version of this website does not intentionally include analytics tracking or advertising pixels. If analytics, advertising or similar tracking technologies are introduced, this policy will be updated to describe their use and applicable privacy choices.</p>

<h2>5. Third-Party Services</h2>
<p>We may use external services for website hosting and, in the future, scheduling, lead management, email delivery and analytics. Those services may have their own privacy policies.</p>

<h2>6. Data Security</h2>
<p>We aim to use appropriate safeguards for personal information processed through our business systems. No electronic storage or internet transmission method is guaranteed to be completely secure.</p>

<h2>7. Data Retention</h2>
<p>Currently, the site's demonstration forms do not retain submitted information. Data retention practices will be updated when lead collection is activated.</p>

<h2>8. Privacy Requests</h2>
<p>When personal information collection is enabled, visitors may contact us about applicable rights to request access to, correction of or deletion of their information, subject to applicable laws and exceptions.</p>

<h2>9. Children's Privacy</h2>
<p>Our services are intended for adults and business operators. This website is not directed to children.</p>

<h2>10. Changes to This Policy</h2>
<p>We may revise this policy when our website, business practices or services change. The effective date will be updated when revisions are published.</p>

<h2>11. Contact Information</h2>
<p>Questions about this policy may be directed to:</p>
<p><strong>Proof Restaurant Consulting</strong><br>
[Legal Business Name]<br>
[Contact Email Address]<br>
[Business Mailing Address, if applicable]</p>

<div class="notice">
<strong>Before publishing:</strong> Replace the bracketed details with your business information and review the policy against the services you actually use. This is a general starting template, not a jurisdiction-specific legal review.
</div>

</div>
</div>
</section>
</main>

<footer>
<div class="container">
<div class="footer-inner">
<div><a class="navbar-brand" href="index.html">proof<span class="logo-dot">.</span></a><p>Restaurant consulting from real operators.</p></div>
<div class="footer-links"><a href="index.html">Home</a><a href="about.html">About</a><a href="contact.html">Contact</a><a href="privacy.html">Privacy</a></div>
</div>
<hr>
<p class="small">&copy; <span class="year"></span> Proof. All rights reserved.</p>
</div>
</footer>

<script>
document.querySelector(".nav-toggle").addEventListener("click",function(){
const open=document.getElementById("nav").classList.toggle("open");
this.setAttribute("aria-expanded",String(open));
});
document.querySelectorAll(".year").forEach(e=>e.textContent=new Date().getFullYear());
</script>
</body>
</html>
